        "id": 1190764
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-13T06:36:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "i\u0027m OK with implementing an over-write policy in the\nfuture, selectable with an option, if there\u0027s a good\ncase for it. my concern is that over-write can lead to thrashing:\nthe EC may do a lot of additional work that the AP (consumer) may\nnever be able to see. also, if due to some error, the AP\ndoesn\u0027t disable tracing, we may end up with the EC doing tracing\nwork when there is no consumer.",
      "parentUuid": "eb1db902_9c6d576f",
      "range": {
